# Business Performance Insights Dashboard

## Overview

The Business Performance Insights Dashboard is an executive reporting solution developed to monitor organizational performance through key performance indicators (KPIs), operational metrics, and business trends.

It provides stakeholders with a high-level view of business performance, enabling timely, data-driven decision-making.

---

## Business Problem

Business leaders require timely access to accurate performance data to evaluate operations, monitor growth, and identify areas requiring improvement.

Traditional reports often lack interactivity and make it difficult to identify trends quickly.

This dashboard addresses these challenges through dynamic visualizations and centralized reporting.

---

## Objectives

- Monitor business KPIs
- Analyse operational performance
- Track business trends
- Support executive decision-making
- Improve organizational reporting

